:: Guardian Reunion {"position":"1250,1250","size":"100,100"}
You return to the village after your long journey.

The archivist is waiting inside the archive.

As you enter, he immediately notices the four glowing objects you carry.

Royal Archivist: "You actually did it..."

Royal Archivist: "The Leviathan, the Dragon, the Phoenix, and the Warden..."

Royal Archivist: "All four guardians have recognized you."

He approaches the objects.

Royal Archivist: "May I?"

You place the four rewards upon his desk.

The crystals begin to glow.

Their lights connect, forming a strange celestial symbol.

The archivist stares at it.

Royal Archivist: "This symbol..."

Royal Archivist: "I've seen it before."

He quickly retrieves an old manuscript from his bookshelf.

Royal Archivist: "The celestial princess."

Royal Archivist: "The four guardians were never meant to stand alone."

Royal Archivist: "Their powers were connected through her."

Royal Archivist: "And now, with the guardians awakened, the path to her kingdom should finally be accessible."

He looks at you.

Royal Archivist: "Traveler, I believe it is time you met Arriguii."
{
(if: $firstGuardian is "Leviathan")[
    Royal Archivist: "The ocean was the first to recognize you."

    Royal Archivist: "Perhaps the Princess will be particularly interested in hearing what the Leviathan told you."
]

(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Dragon")[
    Royal Archivist: "You began your journey among the ruins of the old kingdom."

    Royal Archivist: "I suspect the Dragon's memories may have revealed something important."
]

(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Phoenix")[
    Royal Archivist: "The stars revealed their memories to you first."

    Royal Archivist: "You may understand the Princess's celestial origins better than most."
]

(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Warden")[
    Royal Archivist: "The Forgotten Realm recognized you first."

    Royal Archivist: "That is quite remarkable. The Warden rarely trusts anyone."
]
}
[[Tell me how to find her.->MeetingGuii]]


