:: Leviathan Quest {"position":"900,1400","size":"100,100"}
You arrive at the edge of the coastline, where the water appears unusually dark.

The crystal pendant around your neck begins to glow.

You remember the archivist's words.

"The Leviathan. Guardian of the oceans."

You board a small vessel and sail toward the coordinates marked on your map.

As you approach the location, the sea suddenly becomes still.

A deep rumbling sound echoes beneath the boat.

The water begins to glow.

Something enormous moves beneath the surface.

A voice echoes through your mind.

Leviathan: "Another surface dweller..."

Leviathan: "Have you come to disturb my resting place?"
{
(if: $firstGuardian is "none")[
    The Leviathan studies you carefully.

    Leviathan: "You carry no familiar scent. Who sent you here?"
]
(else:)[
    The Leviathan notices the strange energy surrounding your pendant.
	
    Leviathan: "You have already walked among my kin."
	
    Leviathan: "Interesting. Perhaps you are not as ordinary as you seem."
]
}
Leviathan: "Speak. Why have you come to these waters?"

[[I want to understand what is happening->LeviathanTruth]]

[[I was sent to find the guardians->LeviathanTruth]]


:: LeviathanTrial {"position":"875,1650","size":"100,100"}
You explore the submerged ruins.

After searching the ancient temple, you recover three ocean relics.

Each relic glows with a different shade of blue.

You place them within the temple's central altar.

The entire structure begins to illuminate.

The water surrounding the temple becomes calm.

The Leviathan slowly approaches.

Leviathan: "So the old magic has not completely disappeared."

Leviathan: "You have restored something that was lost."

The enormous creature lowers its head toward you.

Leviathan: "I remember the one who once watched over these waters."

Leviathan: "A little celestial being with a heart far greater than her understanding of this world."

Leviathan: "She was always curious about the surface."

Leviathan: "Always creating strange little things from magic and light."

Leviathan: "I wonder if she still remembers me."

The Leviathan gives you a small glowing scale.

Leviathan: "Take this."

Leviathan: "Should you ever need safe passage through the ocean, my waters will recognize you."

{
(set: $leviathanDone to true)

(if: $firstGuardian is "none")[
    (set: $firstGuardian to "Leviathan")
    The crystal pendant glows with a brilliant blue light.

    You feel a strange connection forming between yourself and the ocean.
]
}
[[Return to the guardian map->Quest Hub]]


:: LeviathanTruth {"position":"750,1525","size":"100,100"}
Leviathan: "The guardians..."

A low rumble travels through the surrounding water.

Leviathan: "It has been many centuries since anyone spoke of us."

Leviathan: "The world above has forgotten what it once owed to the oceans."

You notice several damaged structures surrounding the creature.

Leviathan: "Something has disturbed the ancient seals beneath this sea."

Leviathan: "The currents are changing. The old songs are fading."

Leviathan: "And yet you arrive carrying a fragment of celestial magic."

The Leviathan moves closer.

Leviathan: "If you wish to understand, then help me restore what has been broken."

The Leviathan reveals three glowing relics scattered throughout the ruins.

Leviathan: "Recover the three ocean relics. Return them to their places within the temple."

Leviathan: "Only then will I know whether you can be trusted."

[[Begin exploring the Sunken Kingdom->LeviathanTrial]]


