:: MeetingGuii {"position":"1400,1350","size":"100,100"}
The archivist hands you a small crystal key.

Royal Archivist: "This should open the ancient passage beneath the abandoned lighthouse."

Royal Archivist: "Follow the path beneath the waves. It will lead you to the ocean palace."

You thank the archivist and make your way toward the lighthouse.

The crystal key begins to glow.

An enormous staircase appears beneath the water.

You descend into the depths.

After traveling through the underwater passage, you arrive at a magnificent palace.

Its walls are covered in glowing crystals, and strange celestial symbols illuminate the floor.

You enter the throne room.

For a moment, everything is completely silent.

Then...

A small voice echoes from somewhere behind the throne.

??? : "BYTE! WAIT!"

Something falls over.

??? : "OW! WHO PUT THAT THERE?!"

A tiny pixel-like creature floats into view.

It looks at you.

Then it quickly disappears behind a nearby pillar.

A girl slowly peeks out from behind the throne.

She has long indigo hair with bright cyan highlights, crystal wings, and a glowing halo.

Guii: "H-Hello?"

Guii: "Um... you're not supposed to be here yet."

She looks at the crystal pendant around your neck.

Guii: "Wait..."

Guii: "Where did you get that?"
{
(if: $firstGuardian is "Leviathan")[
    Guii: "The Leviathan gave you one of its scales?"

    Guii: "You met them?!"
]

(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Dragon")[
    Guii: "You actually met the Dragon?"

    Guii: "Oh goodness... I hope they weren't too grumpy."
]

(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Phoenix")[
    Guii: "The Phoenix shared its memories with you?"

    Guii: "I wonder what it showed you..."
]

(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Warden")[
    Guii: "The Crystal Warden recognized you?"

    Guii: "That's... actually really impressive!"
]
}
Guii looks at the four objects you have collected.

Guii: "You met all four guardians?"

She pauses.

Guii: "Oh."

Guii: "Oh no."

Guii: "Does that mean something is happening again?"

The little pixel creature floats beside her.

Guii: "Byte, please tell me you know what's going on."

Byte makes a few electronic beeping noises.

Guii: "You don't know either?!

She sighs.

Guii: "Okay... I think we have a LOT to talk about."

She looks toward you.

Guii: "Um... I'm Arriguii."

Guii: "But you can call me Guii!"

Guii: "Welcome to my kingdom."

THE END

CHAPTER 1 COMPLETE

[[Begin the next chapter->NextChapter]]


