:: Phoenix Quest {"position":"1150,1400","size":"100,100"}
Your journey takes you toward the floating islands of the Shattered Skies.

High above the clouds rests an ancient observatory.

Its towers are covered in crystalline structures, and strange symbols cover its walls.

Your pendant begins to glow.

A beautiful light appears within the observatory.

A magnificent Phoenix emerges, its feathers shimmering with blue, violet, and gold.

Phoenix: "A visitor..."

Phoenix: "It has been a long time since anyone sought the knowledge of the stars."
{
(if: $firstGuardian is "Dragon")[
    Phoenix: "The Dragon has allowed you to leave its ruins?"

    Phoenix: "Then perhaps the past has finally begun to move again."
]
(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Leviathan")[
    Phoenix: "I can sense the ocean within your crystal."

    Phoenix: "The Leviathan has always been a keeper of memories."
]
(else-if: $firstGuardian is "Warden")[
    Phoenix: "The ancient crystals..."

    Phoenix: "So the Forgotten Realm has begun to awaken."
]
}
Phoenix: "Tell me, traveler. What knowledge do you seek?"

[[I wish to understand the celestial realm->PhoenixResearch]]


:: PhoenixMemory {"position":"1150,1650","size":"100,100"}
You explore the floating islands and recover three ancient records.

You place them within the observatory's central mechanism.

The ancient symbols begin to illuminate.

A celestial projection appears above the observatory.

You see a beautiful world filled with stars and light.

A young celestial being watches the world below.

She appears fascinated by the creations of mortals. The vision changes.

You see four enormous creatures standing beneath a celestial sky.

A voice echoes through the observatory.

Unknown Voice: "The guardians must remain connected."

Unknown Voice: "The balance must never be broken."

The vision fades.

Phoenix: "You have witnessed a memory from before the Great Sundering."

Phoenix: "The celestial being you saw was not an ordinary guardian."

Phoenix: "She was destined to watch over the ocean."

Phoenix: "The records speak of a name..."

Phoenix: "Arriguii."

The Phoenix looks toward you.

Phoenix: "I believe you are searching for someone who has been waiting a very long time."

The Phoenix gives you a glowing celestial feather.

Phoenix: "Keep this. It will help you recognize the magic of the stars."
{
(set: $phoenixDone to true)

(if: $firstGuardian is "none")[
    (set: $firstGuardian to "Phoenix")

    The pendant shines with a brilliant golden-violet light.

    For a moment, you feel as though something in the stars is watching over you.
]
}
[[Return to the guardian map->Quest Hub]]


:: PhoenixResearch {"position":"1250,1525","size":"100,100"}
Phoenix: "The celestial realm..."

The Phoenix spreads its wings.

Phoenix: "A place beyond the reach of ordinary mortals."

Phoenix: "Long ago, celestial beings watched over the worlds below."

Phoenix: "They guided the stars, protected the balance of nature, and shaped the foundations of ancient magic."

The Phoenix looks toward the distant sky.

Phoenix: "One among them became particularly fascinated with the world of mortals."

Phoenix: "She admired their creativity, their inventions, and their desire to create things that did not yet exist."

Phoenix: "She was different from the others."

Phoenix: "She wished to understand the world rather than simply watch over it."

The Phoenix turns toward you.

Phoenix: "If you wish to uncover the truth of the celestial realm, you must restore the observatory."

Phoenix: "Three celestial records have been scattered throughout these islands."

Phoenix: "Find them, and the stars may reveal what history has forgotten."

[[Begin searching for the celestial records->PhoenixMemory]]


