:: Quest Accepted {"position":"1100,1125","size":"100,100"}
{(set: $acceptedQuest to true)}

You look down at the glowing crystal resting on the archivist's desk.

You take a moment to consider the journey ahead.

You: "Alright. I'll do it."

You: "I'll find the four guardians and uncover what happened."

The archivist seems relieved.

Royal Archivist: "You have my gratitude."

Royal Archivist: "I wish I could accompany you, but my research belongs here. There are still records I must uncover."

He hands you an old map.

Royal Archivist: "I've marked the locations of the four territories."

Royal Archivist: "The guardians are not creatures to be approached carelessly. Each has its own history, its own trials, and its own reasons for remaining hidden."

Royal Archivist: "Do not assume that strength alone will be enough."

He gives you a small crystal pendant.

Royal Archivist: "This belonged to an old traveler who once explored the shattered realms."

Royal Archivist: "It should help you recognize the ancient magic surrounding the guardians."

The crystal glows faintly.

Royal Archivist: "One last thing..."

Royal Archivist: "The order in which you approach the guardians may reveal different pieces of the past."

Royal Archivist: "Pay attention to what they tell you. Even the smallest detail may prove important."

You take the map and pendant.

(text-style:"bold","underline")[''NEW QUEST:'']
The Four Guardians

Your journey begins.

[[Examine the map and choose your destination.->Quest Hub]]



