:: RoyalRequest {"position":"1200,1000","size":"100,100"}
The archivist becomes unusually quiet.

He looks toward the large bookshelf behind his desk before approaching it.

Royal Archivist: "There is something else I haven't told you."

He reaches behind several old books and retrieves a small wooden box.

Royal Archivist: "I've spent many years researching the Great Sundering."

Royal Archivist: "For a long time, I believed the four guardians were simply creatures of legend."

He opens the box.

Inside rests an ancient crystal, its surface glowing with a faint blue and violet light.

Royal Archivist: "But several months ago, I discovered something hidden within an old celestial manuscript."

He carefully lifts the crystal.

Royal Archivist: "The four guardians were not simply protectors of their respective territories."

Royal Archivist: "They were connected. Their powers were intertwined with the very foundation of our world."

Royal Archivist: "When the Great Sundering occurred, their connection was broken."

Royal Archivist: "And now, after centuries of silence, their power is beginning to stir once again."

The crystal flickers.

Royal Archivist: "I believe something is causing the ancient balance to weaken."

He pauses.

Royal Archivist: "And I believe the mysterious Princess of the Oceans may be connected to all of this."

He places the crystal on the desk.

Royal Archivist: "There is a name written within the oldest records."

Royal Archivist: "Arriguii."

Royal Archivist: "I do not know whether that is her true name, or simply the name given to her by those who once worshipped her."

Royal Archivist: "But if anyone understands the connection between the guardians and the celestial realm, it would be her."

He looks directly at you.

Royal Archivist: "Unfortunately, reaching her will not be as simple as sailing across the ocean."

Royal Archivist: "Before we can find her, we must understand what has happened to the four guardians."

Royal Archivist: "I need you to travel to their respective territories."

Royal Archivist: "Earn the Leviathan's trust. Face the Ancient Dragon. Uncover the truth of the Phoenix. And restore the Crystal Warden."

Royal Archivist: "Each guardian holds a piece of the history we have lost."

Royal Archivist: "Together, those pieces may finally reveal what caused the Great Sundering."

He takes a step back.

Royal Archivist: "I know this is a great deal to ask of a stranger."

Royal Archivist: "But I have a feeling you are exactly the person we have been waiting for."

What will you do?

[[I accept. I'll find the four guardians.->Quest Accepted]]

[[I need some time to think.->Story Hub]]



